8", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75348041_3314433395442771_2202454263537393708_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pRVEzsIz2kkQ7kNvwF8iDaL&_nc_oc=AdlTM9eWQsgyvSOYklfJju6oPxBvmu6ER3me6qBO2OuwJYqdXL0KsnXRTUhHpszki3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz7l4W_Xb-DJSHgRsWqaAg011PasKa9ROGcu2Zj7YNGuw&oe=69BE7EE3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560.png", "id": "816547639394412", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035322_816547642727745_7998601187497381217_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_q4LCOCyh8AQ7kNvwFB89Xl&_nc_oc=AdmeZ1Kt8gJL1wx6_6Dt6UnOUJQwaHugglP_b2CY7gkZssTayWZT6O7qq1bGOAlKaRc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx4Bxp9apW6NM94N-ZWlS4_UOEyhbH-P0q5W1fMbBgTgA&oe=69BE97A5"}, "display_name": "House of the Butcher", "keywords": ["horror", "shooter", "quest", "puzzle", "evil"], "long_description": "House of the Butcher is a virtual reality escape the room style game with shooter elements. \nOne day while camping, you discover a killer. Trying to escape, you find yourself in his lair. You have to search for items, solve puzzles and find a way out while the butcher is hunting you. Don't let him get close by shooting him or using your axe. \nYour main task is to survive at any cost.\n\nKey Features\n- Support Oculus Quest 2 & 3\n- Two types of weapons\n- Many different puzzles\n- Free Movement\n- Smooth motion and framerate\n", "short_description": "House of the Butcher is a virtual reality escape the room style game with shooter elements."}]}, "developer_name": "Yurii Kaplunov", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raptorsreality.com/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Raptor`s Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://raptorsreality.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_ca